New Air Discipline Spells: Lightning Bolt & Chain Lightning
Air mages now have access to two new offensive spells!

Lightning Bolt - A single-target electrical damage spell available
starting at 20 percent learnedness. Channels atmospheric electricity
into a crackling bolt that strikes a single enemy with devastating
force.

Chain Lightning - An advanced multi-target spell available starting
at 80 percent learnedness. The initial bolt strikes your target, then
arcs to additional enemies in the room. More intelligent casters can
sustain additional arcs. Each arc deals reduced damage as the
lightning dissipates.

Both spells cannot be cast underwater, and losing control may cause
the lightning to arc back at the caster! See the help files for each
spell for more details.
